Package: dengue.vacina.tak003
Title: Dengue vaccination (TAK-003) at ages 10-14 in the Brazilian public health system and dengue hospitalizations, Brazil 2017-2025
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Reproducible analysis project (not an installable package). This file exists so that
    renv records the dependencies in renv.lock (explicit snapshot). Scripts in R/, data in data/,
    outputs in outputs/.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: data.table, fixest, ggplot2, patchwork, arrow, curl, jsonlite, stringi,
    flextable, officer, sf, geobr, remotes, renv, microdatasus, brpop
Remotes: rfsaldanha/microdatasus, rfsaldanha/brpop
Encoding: UTF-8
